      "caption": "Two graphs, one motion",
      "duration_ms": 8000,
      "id": "s1",
      "narration": "A displacement-time graph and a velocity-time graph can describe the same journey. Here the s-t line is straight, so the motion is uniform; the v-t line sits flat, because the speed never changes.",
